member.summary:
Get the path of a GS1-128 bar code: start C, FNC1, digit pairs in code set C, a trailing odd digit in code set A, checksum, stop.
The data is the concatenation of the application identifiers and their values (ex: "0109501101530003" for AI 01 (GTIN));
no FNC1 separators can be inserted, so a variable length field must be the last one.

Add an image:
if  starts with '<' it's treated as an svg document and embedded using ,
if it's an existing local file (not containing "://" and not a data uri) the file is read and embedded as a data uri (the sizing and gravity are not applied),
else an image element referencing the url is added (with preserveAspectRatio set from the sizing and gravity).
Note: local files are read, so don't pass untrusted urls.
